# Student register form (`/students/register`)

This is a **3-step wizard**, not a list page. Do not apply list-page chrome (clustered filter/toggle/+, ice canvas, `fk-card` flattening) here.

## Keep

- **Navy `FikrPageHeader`** with the pixel-square motif. Title + subtitle only. No `:eyebrow`. No back control in `#leading`.
- Stepper (student → parent → group) and the **soft primary→teal gradient** on the stepper and each step card header.
- Rounded white cards (`rounded-2xl`, hairline border, light ring). Photo circle + camera button on step 1.
- Fields use `.reg-input` / `.fk-field` (global outlined tokens: rounded-lg, gray border, primary focus ring). 2-column grid on md+.
- Step actions stay **in the card footer**, not a navy `fk-actionbar`: primary green Next/Register, white Previous.

## Do not

- Do not replace the navy hero with a white page header or `canvas="ice"`.
- Do not restyle this page to look like grades/users lists.
- Do not revert to the old purple mock in `design-screenshots/admin/student-register__base.png`.
- Do not change the 3-step flow or field set unless asked.
